{"obsah":"<p>A traditional exhibition date is European Car-Free Day, when our team is fully booked. This year the fastest to book were the organisers in Štětí and in Prague. Lukáš Valný, Marek Tryner and, somewhat unplanned, Matouš Balík rode together at Náměstí Republiky in Prague, enjoying a beautiful sunny day.</p>\n\n<p>Vlasta and Martin Šimůnek, on the other hand, had slightly gloomy weather, but still pleasant riding on the square in Štětí, where kids from local schools came along.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>Both events were also workshops where kids could borrow Trial and regular MTB bikes to try out.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F7ddf0f04-77b4-48bc-9f2b-07d3ffbafeb3.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F7ddf0f04-77b4-48bc-9f2b-07d3ffbafeb3.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"194186\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F7ddf0f04-77b4-48bc-9f2b-07d3ffbafeb3.webp?alt=media\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=194186\" class=\"wp-image-194186\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F5a75945d-9c33-46d1-b4ff-9dbae8d549fb.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F5a75945d-9c33-46d1-b4ff-9dbae8d549fb.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"194187\" data-full-url=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F09%2F5a75945d-9c33-4